        <div class="sm">${D("Legend (colour \u2192 meaning). Select a row, then click the picture to take its colour.","Ch\xFA th\xEDch (m\xE0u \u2192 ngh\u0129a). Ch\u1ECDn m\u1ED9t d\xF2ng r\u1ED3i b\u1EA5m l\xEAn \u1EA3nh \u0111\u1EC3 l\u1EA5y \u0111\xFAng m\xE0u.","\uBC94\uB840")}</div>
